{"product":{"id":9365371060498,"title":"EMT Conduit Hinge Set","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eWe are thrilled to offer these hinges in collaboration with Billy from NorthWoods Engineered. These 3D printed latches are designed specifically for EMT Conduit which you can find locally available in hardware and home improvement stores. They are made from PETG which is UV resistant and holds up well in outdoor applications. To install them you will drill 1\/4\" holes in the desired position on the conduit and use the included 1\/4\" hardware to secure the hinges in place. \u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Includes 2 hinges and hardware.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- split --\u003e\n\u003ch1 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eHinge Overview \u0026amp; Assembly\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-embed=\"285tR0z-6sw\" class=\"youtube\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"play-button\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"row cc-two-columns\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"eight columns alpha\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eSee The Hinges In Action\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-embed=\"5nzFvFw64O8\" class=\"youtube\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"play-button\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"eight columns omega\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003eMaker Pipe Tests The Parts\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv data-embed=\"2FL81hjeDvQ\" class=\"youtube\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"play-button\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\